abstract: >-
  Open and reproducible research software for studying cross-task transfer
  across electricity consumption, renewable generation and day-ahead market
  price in Türkiye using official EPİAŞ Transparency Platform data. The
  repository includes chronological forecasting infrastructure, uncertainty
  calibration, empirical data-audit provenance and an open-science publication
  workflow.